# Copy to `.env` and adjust. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# Scope: the operator plane's database. Every other variable in this repository is
# read at its point of use and documented there — `services/indexer/ponder.config.ts`
# for the indexer's addresses and start block, `packages/keeper/src/cli.ts` for the
# keeper's key and RPC, `apps/*/app/_data.ts` for the surfaces' service URLs. Listing
# them twice would guarantee one list goes stale.

# The one database. Matches `docker-compose.yml` exactly, so `docker compose up -d
# postgres` and this line are the whole local setup.
#
# Its presence is also a switch: `services/origination` serves checkout sessions from
# Postgres when this is set and from process memory when it is not, and it says which
# at startup. Unset it and sessions die with the process.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://plazo:plazo@localhost:5432/plazo

# Where integration tests may create, fill and drop tables.
#
# Separate from `DATABASE_URL` on purpose: a test suite that truncates is one typo away
# from truncating whatever the developer was looking at. Point it at a different
# database, not a different schema — schema separation is already carrying the
# chain/operator split and should not be asked to carry test isolation as well.
PLAZO_TEST_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://plazo:plazo@localhost:5432/plazo_test
